# 24. Result Table

The result table should support:

```text
┌────┬──────────────┬───────────────┬─────────────────┐
│ #  │ Source Layer │ Feature       │ Matched Target  │
├────┼──────────────┼───────────────┼─────────────────┤
│ 1  │ Buildings    │ Building #101 │ Flood Zone #2   │
│ 2  │ Buildings    │ Building #102 │ River #4        │
│ 3  │ Buildings    │ Building #105 │ Flood Zone #3   │
└────┴──────────────┴───────────────┴─────────────────┘
```

If one source matches multiple targets, use an expandable representation:

```text
Building #101
    ├── Flood Zone #2
    └── Flood Zone #3
```

Do not duplicate the source row unnecessarily. 

